<BaseLayout title={page.title} ogType="website" description="At Dinweys Biotech , we simplify the global sourcing of high-quality animal nutrition solutions. By integrating factory-direct supply with expert..." canonical="/about/" hreflang={hreflang}>
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<div class="entry-content single-content"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id56_3f32c9-c8 alignfull kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-layout-overlay kt-row-overlay-normal"></div><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-bottom kb-theme-content-width"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column56_322566-fd inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-56_e3f04f-95"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div><h1 class="kt-adv-heading56_69515d-c5 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading56_69515d-c5">About Dinweys Biotech: Your Integrated Global Sales &amp; Service Hub</h1><p class="kt-adv-heading56_1584a9-32 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-8-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading56_1584a9-32">At <strong>Dinweys Biotech</strong>, we simplify the global sourcing of high-quality animal nutrition solutions. By integrating <strong>factory-direct supply</strong> with <strong>expert international trade services</strong>, we provide a stable, cost-effective, and transparent supply chain for farms and <a href="/product/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="4" title="Feed additives">feed</a> companies in over 20 countries.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id56_2c6407-b0 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column56_fea4f4-57"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id56_9491f7-df alignnone has-theme-palette7-background-color kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column56_44f460-c8"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Who We Are: The Strategic Bridge to China’s Feed Additive Industry</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Trusted Global Partner in Animal Nutrition &amp; Feed Additives</em></p><blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Dinweys Biotech</strong> operates as the <strong>dedicated global sales and export division</strong> for a group of qualified feed additive manufacturers in China.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Unlike traditional trading companies, we are <strong>deeply integrated with our partner production bases</strong>. We act as their international face, managing everything from technical communication and regulatory compliance to complex global logistics. This model allows our partner factories to focus on production excellence while we ensure that our global clients receive <strong>factory-direct pricing</strong> paired with <strong>world-class service</strong>.</p><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Our Core Expertise</strong></h3><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Strategic Manufacturing Partnership:</strong> We maintain an exclusive/deep cooperation with ISO and FAMI-QS certified facilities specializing in <strong><a href="/product/choline-chloride-60/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="1" title="Choline Chloride 60% Feed Additive – Corn Cob Carrier China Manufacturer Supply">Choline Chloride</a>, <a href="/product_category/vitamins/" data-internallinksmanager029f6b8e52c="2" title="vitamins">Vitamins</a>, Amino Acids, and Mineral feed additives</strong>.</li><li><strong>Technical Oversight:</strong> Our team doesn&#8217;t just &#8220;sell&#8221;—we provide technical alignment between client formulations and factory production standards.</li><li><strong>Global Compliance:</strong> We bridge the gap between Chinese manufacturing and international regulatory requirements, ensuring smooth customs clearance and product acceptance.</li></ul></blockquote><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Technical Support &amp; Value-Added Services</h2><blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We go beyond &#8220;moving products.&#8221; We provide a comprehensive service suite designed to optimize your sourcing experience:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>End-to-End Logistics:</strong> Strategic planning of sea, air, and land freight to minimize lead times and reduce total landed costs.</li><li><strong>Technical Consultation:</strong> Expert guidance on product grades, inclusion rates, and application optimization for different animal species.</li><li><strong>Regulatory &amp; Documentation Support:</strong> Assistance with import permits, health certificates, and country-specific documentation to ensure 100% compliance.</li><li><strong>Quality Assurance &amp; Oversight:</strong> We coordinate with partner laboratories to provide batch-specific COAs (Certificate of Analysis) and conduct pre-shipment inspections.</li></ul></blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id56_597056-6a alignfull has-theme-palette8-background-color kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-layout-overlay kt-row-overlay-gradient"></div><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-right-golden kt-tab-layout-left-golden kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column56_d02322-fe"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><h2 class="kt-adv-heading56_8c61d9-91 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading56_8c61d9-91">Technical Strength</h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our strength lies in the <strong>synergy between production and service</strong>.</p><ol start="1" class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Direct Oversight:</strong> We work on-site with our partner factories to monitor production schedules and quality consistency.</li><li><strong>Expert Team:</strong> Our staff consists of food engineers and export specialists who understand the nuances of animal nutrition and international trade.</li><li><strong>Global Track Record:</strong> With a history of serving 100+ clients across 20+ countries, we understand the specific market needs of different regions.</li></ol></div></div><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column56_8ec7ce-80"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"></div></div></div></div><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id56_78e2f9-87 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width"><div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column56_d3b7a8-bb"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><h2 class="kt-adv-heading56_14d7a2-0a wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-7-background-color has-background" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading56_14d7a2-0a">The <strong>Verification</strong> of <strong>Our Company </strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">In an era where trust is paramount, <strong>Dinweys Biotech</strong> (Zhangjiakou Dingwei Biotechnology Co., Ltd.) prioritizes absolute transparency. We invite our partners to verify our legal and operational status:</p><figure class="wp-block-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><thead><tr><td><strong>Verification Detail</strong></td><td><strong>Information</strong></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Official Company Name</strong></td><td>Zhangjiakou Dingwei Biotechnology Co., Ltd.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Business License (USCI)</strong></td><td>91130702MADY9DX57U</td></tr><tr><td><strong>D-U-N-S® Number</strong></td><td><strong>456653698</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Customs Registration No.</strong></td><td>1307961A3J</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Headquarters</strong></td><td>Zhangjiakou City, Hebei Province, China</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Verification Resources:</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">You may verify our credentials through the National Enterprise Credit Information Publicity System (China) or D&amp;B (Dun &amp; Bradstreet). Additional documentation (Business License, Tax Certificates, or Factory Audit Reports) is available upon request.</p></div></div></div></div><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p></div>`} />
